      "data": {
        "html": "<p>Related documentations:</p><ul><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.mathworks.com/help/predmaint/ug/anomaly-detection-using-3-axis-vibration-data.html\" data-favicon=\"content/assets/ef0eca8b5b903f64.ico\" data-previewed=\"\" style=\"--_favicon: url(&quot;/content/assets/ef0eca8b5b903f64.ico&quot;);\">Detect Anomalies in Industrial Machinery Using Three-Axis Vibration Data - MATLAB &amp; Simulink</a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.mathworks.com/help/predmaint/ug/industrial-cooling-fan-anomaly-detection-with-docker-deployment.html\" data-favicon=\"content/assets/ef0eca8b5b903f64.ico\" data-previewed=\"\" style=\"--_favicon: url(&quot;/content/assets/ef0eca8b5b903f64.ico&quot;);\">Industrial Cooling Fan Anomaly Detection Algorithm Development for Deployment to a Microservice Docker Image - MATLAB &amp; Simulink</a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.mathworks.com/help/signal/ug/anomaly-detection-using-convolutional-autoencoder-with-wavelet-scattering-sequences.html\" data-favicon=\"content/assets/ef0eca8b5b903f64.ico\" data-previewed=\"\" style=\"--_favicon: url(&quot;/content/assets/ef0eca8b5b903f64.ico&quot;);\">Anomaly Detection Using Convolutional Autoencoder with Wavelet Scattering Sequences - MATLAB &amp; Simulink</a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.mathworks.com/help/signal/ug/detect-anomalies-in-signals-using-deep-learning.html\" data-favicon=\"content/assets/ef0eca8b5b903f64.ico\" data-previewed=\"\" style=\"--_favicon: url(&quot;/content/assets/ef0eca8b5b903f64.ico&quot;);\">Detect Anomalies in Signals Using deepSignalAnomalyDetector - MATLAB &amp; Simulink</a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.mathworks.com/help/signal/ug/detect-anomalies-in-machinery-using-lstm-autoencoder.html\" data-favicon=\"content/assets/ef0eca8b5b903f64.ico\" data-previewed=\"\" style=\"--_favicon: url(&quot;/content/assets/ef0eca8b5b903f64.ico&quot;);\">Detect Anomalies in Signals Using deepSignalAnomalyDetector - MATLAB &amp; Simulink</a></p></li></ul><ul><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.mathworks.com/help/dsp/ug/fault-detection-and-localization-in-three-phase-power-transmission.html\" data-favicon=\"content/assets/ef0eca8b5b903f64.ico\" data-previewed=\"\" style=\"--_favicon: url(&quot;/content/assets/ef0eca8b5b903f64.ico&quot;);\">Fault Detection and Localization in Three-Phase Power Transmission Using Deep Signal Anomaly Detector in Simulink - MATLAB &amp; Simulink</a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.mathworks.com/help/audio/ug/audio-based-anomaly-detection-for-machine-health-monitoring.html\" data-favicon=\"content/assets/ef0eca8b5b903f64.ico\" data-previewed=\"\" style=\"--_favicon: url(&quot;/content/assets/ef0eca8b5b903f64.ico&quot;);\">Audio-Based Anomaly Detection for Machine Health Monitoring - MATLAB &amp; Simulink</a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.mathworks.com/help/wavelet/ug/detect-anomalies-using-wavelet-scattering-with-autoencoders.html\" data-favicon=\"content/assets/ef0eca8b5b903f64.ico\" data-previewed=\"\" style=\"--_favicon: url(&quot;/content/assets/ef0eca8b5b903f64.ico&quot;);\">Detect Anomalies Using Wavelet Scattering with Autoencoders - MATLAB &amp; Simulink</a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.mathworks.com/help/deeplearning/ug/time-series-anomaly-detection-using-deep-learning.html\" data-favicon=\"content/assets/ef0eca8b5b903f64.ico\" data-previewed=\"\" style=\"--_favicon: url(&quot;/content/assets/ef0eca8b5b903f64.ico&quot;);\">Time Series Anomaly Detection Using Deep Learning - MATLAB &amp; Simulink</a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.mathworks.com/help/deeplearning/ug/multivariate-time-series-anomaly-detection-using-graph-neural-network.html\" data-favicon=\"content/assets/ef0eca8b5b903f64.ico\" data-previewed=\"\" style=\"--_favicon: url(&quot;/content/assets/ef0eca8b5b903f64.ico&quot;);\">Multivariate Time Series Anomaly Detection Using Graph Neural Network - MATLAB &amp; Simulink</a></p></li></ul><p></p>",
